contentText:
Lily Allen canceled her first show in New Zealand in seven years on Tuesday night (Oct. 20) just hours before showtime due to illness. In an Instagram Story message to fans, the singer wrote, &#8220;To my West End Girls in Auckland, I am so sorry to have to tell you that I have come down with a viral infection and am unable to perform tonight.&#8221;

